{"text": "Geppetto held Pinocchio under the arms and taught him how to walk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pinocchios legs were stiff at first, but soon he was walking around the room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly he jumped through the open door and ran out into the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Catch him, Catch him, shouted Geppetto, who was running after him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The people in the street only laughed at the wooden puppet, which ran like a rabbit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last, a policeman stood in the middle of the road and caught him by the nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Geppetto ran up and said, You will come home with me now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Pinocchio threw himself on the ground and would not walk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A crowd gathered, and some people said that Geppetto was a cruel old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They thought he would treat the puppet badly when they got home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the policeman let Pinocchio go and took poor Geppetto to prison instead.", "alignment": {"characters": ["G", "e", "p", "p", "e", "t", "t", "o", " ", "h", "e", "l", "d", " ", "P", "i", "n", "o", "c", "c", "h", "i", "o", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "r", "m", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "h", "o", "w", " ", "t", "o", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "P", "i", "n", "o", "c", "c", "h", "i", "o", "s", " ", "l", "e", "g", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "t", "i", "f", "f", " ", "a", "t", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "s", "o", "o", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/